    "src/counter.tua": "final class Counter {\n value: number = 0\n --- Increase the counter.\n ---@param amount number Units to add.\n ---@return Self The same counter.\n add(amount: number): Self {\n  self.value += amount\n  return self\n }\n}\nexport type CounterInstance = Counter\nreturn { Counter = Counter }\n",
